    given-names: Van-Quynh
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-0514-6123"
    affiliation: Posts and Telecommunications Institute of Technology (PTIT)
version: 3.0.5
date-released: "2026-10-25"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tvquynh/openalex-literature-intelligence"
abstract: >-
  Command-line tool that builds an auditable literature corpus: OpenAlex discovery,
  SCImago 2010-2025 venue enrichment (SJR, quartiles, categories, estimated APC) at the
  publication year and the latest snapshot, policy-based screening of a main corpus,
  and a recorded reason for every exclusion.
keywords:
  - openalex
  - scimago
  - literature-review
  - systematic-review
  - bibliometrics
  - research-reproducibility
